r (tbobj.go's frameSlots; queue 219)"] [54 2 "// lineStarts are the instructions that may start a line event, by instruction (trace.go's traceLines; queue 219t)"] [56 2 "// obj is the code's object (co_* attributes), one per code so that frame.f_code is func.__code__ (queue 219t)"] [58 2 "// parent is the code whose constant this is; imports, on a module's, the names its scope binds by import (queue 229)"] [61 2 "// view is CPython's bytecode of the code, made when asked (bytecode_asm.go)"] [63 26 "// the jumps flow! threaded (the IR's :threaded)"] [69 1 "// codePos is an instruction's end line (less its line) and columns (0-based UTF-8 byte offsets), Col -1 when unknown:"] [70 1 "// co_positions' last three items (the first, the line, is Lines')."] [78 1 "// debugRanges is config.code_debug_ranges: false under -X no_debug_ranges or PYTHONNODEBUGRANGES (the code objects then"] [79 1 "// carry no columns: co_positions' None, no caret lines)"] [88 1 "// Position is instruction pc's location as co_positions gives it: line, end line, column, end column, each 0 when"] [89 1 "// unknown (ok false for the columns)."] [107 1 "// decodePositions reads positionsText: per instruction \"COL,END-COL[,END-LINE-LESS-LINE]\" or \"\" (no columns), \";\""] [108 1 "// between them (arbace.python.compile's positions-of). codePos.EndLine holds the end line less the line."] [134 1 "// compileWarning is a SyntaxWarning the compiler made: its message and location (1-based offsets, 0 unknown)."] [140 1 "// NativeFunc is a code object's compiled body (PY8's AOT, aot.go): it runs f from f.PC as step does"] [141 1 "// (the value returned, an error raised, or a *pushFrame for a call of a Python function)."] [144 1 "// CodeKind is the IR's :kind."] [159 1 "// CodeFlags are the IR's :flags."] [170 24 "// CO_ITERABLE_COROUTINE: a generator types.coroutine marked (set at run time, PY5d)"] [173 1 "// Instr is an instruction: the operation and its argument decoded into two integers (§7.2's table:"] [